                                                "sense_id": "61e440d9-4d0c-36fc-8627-3d58c71884d1",
                                                "text": "Even white activists who lacked a thoroughgoing anti-racist consciousness or were uneven in their understanding saw unity in the struggle against all forms of oppression as key."
